{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五月初十日准提菩薩聖誕"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以上俱念三遍"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先敷具，胡跪，拈香，起立，執爐，想云。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "想已，長跪作梵唱云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一心奉請"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "每位長跪執爐三請一叩首下倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "請已，白云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白已，讚云："}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一拜，後同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此下照前拜念大慈大悲本尊教主等云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照前拜念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照前拜念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照前拜念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照前拜念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照前拜念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "照前拜念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上諸位隨偈解相禮時作觀，惟首尊總具相好，百七十七俱胝數佛同時顯現，受我敬禮。末尊應觀一\n身十八臂，有八菩薩圍遶八方，餘隨偈作觀，重在手持何物。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "先唱偈，然後頂禮，餘倣此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "跪念"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或一、或三、或七遍，伺出壇，在觀堂持百八遍。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "四句一拜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "行者入觀誦持時，先當了知諸佛眾生，與我此心，同一圓明，竪窮橫徧，現前一念，具足無減，無二無別，而\n恒安住甚深境界，慈念有情，以三密相應，而作悉地。然持中所示觀雖多，無越梵字呪聲，總相別相，又復\n遠離能觀所觀，能持所持，一事一理，皆是不思議秘密理境。如是行持，何愁佛果不圓，罪障不滅，悉地不\n成耶？"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "T51n2068_p0082b03"}
{"id": null, "n": "0562001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0562001 #note_star_1", "type": "orig", "text": "阿疑呵次同"}
{"id": null, "n": "0562002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0562002", "type": "orig", "text": "繫疑擊"}
